OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest over British
OL,4,Atourist's Greece death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurdering a British woman who died in
OL,8,FGreece earlier this year, an inquest
OL,9,Fopening has heard.
OL,11,FJacqueline Causton was found
OL,12,Funresponsive at her villa on the island
OL,13,Fof Zakynthos on 14 May, Doncaster
OL,14,FCoroner's Court heard.
OL,16,FShe was taken to a local hospital on
OL,17,Fthe island, also known as Zante, but
OL,18,Flater pronounced dead and her body was
OL,19,Fsubsequently repatriated.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
