OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest over British
OL,4,Atourist's Greece death
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Con Mike Tilley, of South Yorkshire
OL,7,FPolice, told the court a man had been
OL,8,Farrested on 12 June on suspicion of
OL,9,Fmurder, before being bailed and then
OL,10,Fre-arrested last weekend when "fresh
OL,11,Fevidence" emerged.
